  m_text: "<b>Kolob\u011Bh podnik\xE1n\xED</b>\r\n\r\nV podnik\xE1n\xED h\xE1z\xED\u0161
    po\u010Dtem kostek podle sv\xE9ho vzd\u011Bl\xE1n\xED. N\xE1sledn\u011B si vybere\u0161
    po\u0159ad\xED, v jak\xE9m chce\u0161 kostky hr\xE1t. M\u016F\u017Ee\u0161 se
    pohybovat \u010Dty\u0159mi sm\u011Bry, ale nesm\xED\u0161 se vracet ve sv\xFDch
    stop\xE1ch a nem\u016F\u017Ee\u0161 j\xEDt p\u0159es okraj desky. \nMus\xED\u0161
    se rozhodovat rychle, proto\u017Ee m\xE1\u0161 jen minutu na odehr\xE1n\xED.
    Pokud \u010Dasom\xEDra dob\u011Bhne, bere\u0161 si dv\u011B karty \u0161patn\xFDch
    ud\xE1lost\xED a vr\xE1t\xED\u0161 se na za\u010D\xE1te\u010Dn\xED pol\xED\u010Dko.
    \nPokud projde\u0161 pol\xED\u010Dkem se smajl\xEDkem, l\xED\u017Ee\u0161 si
    kartu ud\xE1losti. Pokud skon\u010D\xED\u0161 na zelen\xE9m \u017Eetonku, dostane\u0161
    od st\xE1tu mimo\u0159\xE1dnou dotaci a \u017Eeton zmiz\xED.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3eddeefc040d8849a0d65831067d9b3, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2238194723656953113, guid: a3eddeefc040d8849a0d65831067d9b3, type: 2}
